;A little readme from the translator (Pedy):
;Main resources: TW Dialogue by ぶらいと - Blight/Bright? (this, first work of his btw), YM Marisa Dialogue by NEMO (author of J Nazrin, Reverse Momiji), J+ Marisa Dialogue by 姉萌ね, RR Marisa Dialogue by Japanese Anon.
