;Additional lines were taken mostly as-is from YM Reimu by baru (license allows reuse), YM Ran by Enter (with his permission), and an erotic novel by Reavski with his permission (archiveofourown.org/works/27863438 some lines were so good I used them as is)
;The rest of minor line additions were credited where they were added unless they're written by me
;
;I wanted to expand Marisa's dialogue because the current state of it was frankly inadequate considering her status as a protagonist
;for this Marisa, I didn't want to make her accent too thick, so I went with the milder approach. The ze option compensates for it in my opinion
;I tried to play around with various events this time to see how it'll turn out
;According to the concept, this Marisa wasn't written as a maiden, but as someone assertive who will play with you a lot. At the same time, tohoJ's Marisa is a maiden, and very inexperienced, although knowledgable and curios.
;However the degree of her playfulness doesn't go that high even in the original dialogue, only seen in counter actions. Perhaps the author changed his mind? Marisa acts rather bashfully and often makes the "maiden" excuse
;Therefore I decided to balance those concepts out by making Marisa start out as pure (compulsory-- err I mean mandatory), who quickly becomes a naughty, pervy, dirty girl, lapsing into degeneracy perhaps. Once she tastes the pleasure, she won't be able to let go of it, even though she will try to resist it at first, and the embarrassment of it will continue to torment her
